WEBVTT

00:03.690 --> 00:05.320
If you can do it,

00:05.820 --> 00:09.530
There's no way I can't do it!

00:09.530 --> 00:13.910
Iflamme Burdelyon!

00:26.920 --> 00:27.920
Sion!

00:30.360 --> 00:33.430
No way.
Even that didn't finish it off?

00:33.870 --> 00:36.810
It took an advanced spell
at close range, and yet...

00:36.810 --> 00:38.810
What a monster.

00:38.810 --> 00:41.940
A wand can't win.

00:42.330 --> 00:45.190
A sword also can't defeat it.

00:50.450 --> 00:51.950
This is...

00:58.120 --> 01:00.460
Remember, Will.

01:00.960 --> 01:03.460
It's wand and sword.

01:14.260 --> 01:16.100
Are you sure about this?

01:16.100 --> 01:17.560
Stop asking the same question.

01:17.560 --> 01:19.730
I've made my choice.

01:20.150 --> 01:22.960
This is all to protect this world.

01:25.150 --> 01:31.020
One day, wand and sword
will come together.

01:37.120 --> 01:39.830
Wand and sword.

01:43.750 --> 01:45.250
Sion!

01:45.670 --> 01:46.670
I need your spell!

01:46.670 --> 01:48.170
The answer is wand and sword!

01:53.470 --> 01:55.610
Ignis Rooks!

02:04.100 --> 02:05.690
Is that...

02:05.690 --> 02:06.360
No way.

02:10.110 --> 02:11.610
Wis!

02:12.780 --> 02:13.860
What is that?

02:14.300 --> 02:16.660
The sword is clad in flames?

02:16.660 --> 02:19.620
Is it an enchantment?
No, it's different.

02:20.070 --> 02:22.370
The spell was devoured?

02:23.040 --> 02:25.500
Flunkee, you...

02:34.050 --> 02:35.890
Everything I see is red.

02:36.390 --> 02:37.850
I'm brimming with power.

02:38.350 --> 02:41.890
As if urged on by a power
rushing through me.

02:41.890 --> 02:45.100
I found myself muttering the spell.

02:45.810 --> 02:47.770
Fully charged.

03:03.250 --> 03:05.540
Ignis Wis!

04:40.090 --> 04:43.350
EPISODE 12: WAND AND SWORD

05:18.300 --> 05:20.800
My strength is leaving me.

05:22.680 --> 05:24.760
My sword has gone back to normal?

05:26.640 --> 05:29.390
What was that, really?

05:29.980 --> 05:32.400
He defeated the Grand Duke.

05:32.400 --> 05:33.520
Will!

05:40.150 --> 05:42.530
Hordes of Sentinels and Guards?!

05:43.110 --> 05:46.530
Did they rush over here after hearing
the Grand Duke's death cry?

05:47.070 --> 05:48.370
Oh no...

05:49.000 --> 05:52.790
We no longer have
any strength left to fight.

05:53.250 --> 05:54.790
Damn it.

05:57.040 --> 05:59.170
Hurry, Workner!

05:59.710 --> 06:01.300
Stay away!

06:02.680 --> 06:04.800
It's no good.
We won't make it in time.

06:05.210 --> 06:06.300
Julius!

06:13.890 --> 06:15.480
Pass judgment.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.730
Sage-king, vanquisher of evil.

06:19.820 --> 06:22.570
Loi Eluza.

06:29.580 --> 06:33.210
Advanced annihilation spell?
Who could've...

06:38.920 --> 06:41.420
That wand... Could it be...

06:45.550 --> 06:47.180
You are...

06:49.560 --> 06:52.980
MASTERIAS NOAH - AARON MASTERIAS OLDKING
Aaron Masterias Oldking.

06:52.980 --> 06:54.100
MASTERIAS NOAH - AARON MASTERIAS OLDKING

06:56.850 --> 07:00.610
The king of the Magia Vander,
the strongest wand.

07:01.940 --> 07:03.320
What is he doing here?

07:04.650 --> 07:06.950
Deep dungeon equipment?

07:07.410 --> 07:09.480
Was they on their way back
from an expedition?

07:12.450 --> 07:15.250
I've bestowed the blessing of light

07:15.250 --> 07:18.960
to those who've stood against
the darkness of the dungeon.

07:19.380 --> 07:24.470
Well fought, children of magic.

07:29.470 --> 07:30.970
We're saved!

07:32.390 --> 07:38.980
All the mages, even the elf,
bowed reverently as they trembled in joy.

07:39.400 --> 07:43.480
As everyone's attention was directed
towards the Lord of Light.

07:44.490 --> 07:46.110
But my eyes...

07:46.820 --> 07:48.990
...were drawn to him.

07:54.790 --> 07:56.080
I'm surprised.

07:57.000 --> 07:59.250
The sword is still alive.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.670
What's your name?

08:07.340 --> 08:10.180
Will Serfort.

08:11.050 --> 08:12.430
And you are?

08:15.770 --> 08:16.980
I'm Finn.

08:17.560 --> 08:18.940
Just Finn.

08:29.780 --> 08:34.330
Good thing we went to pick up
the goods as fast as possible.

08:34.790 --> 08:39.710
We wouldn't have been able to
if they pursued us.

08:41.190 --> 08:44.460
I'd much prefer not to run into them.

08:45.340 --> 08:48.220
But still, we completed
the mission successfully.

08:50.300 --> 08:53.100
Now, we can celebrate
with a party from Hell.

09:02.100 --> 09:05.780
The abnormal turn of events brought
the All-Student Praxis to a close.

09:06.530 --> 09:10.990
There were eleven deaths,
all of them were the Academy professors.

09:11.660 --> 09:16.370
Thanks to the efforts of those who managed
to survive, no students were killed.

09:17.040 --> 09:22.080
Based on eyewitness reports,
warrants were put out for the perpetrators,

09:22.080 --> 09:24.040
but no clues have yet to be found.

09:24.880 --> 09:27.880
Unable to shake off the aftertaste,

09:27.880 --> 09:31.880
the survivors rest for a moment.

09:38.680 --> 09:42.650
Who were those creepy guys anyway?

09:43.100 --> 09:44.610
I don't know either.

09:44.610 --> 09:50.530
One thing is for sure, they were crazy
enough to murder the professors.

09:51.030 --> 09:55.750
I still can't believe that Professor Bruno
and other professors are really dead.

09:56.740 --> 09:57.990
Colette.

09:59.950 --> 10:05.330
If not for the great mage Masterias Noah,
I wonder what would happen to us now.

10:06.000 --> 10:08.300
But we're alive.

10:08.920 --> 10:13.510
None of us died in the face of
that terrifying opponent,

10:13.510 --> 10:16.720
nor did I become a martyr
due to my knight's duty.

10:18.010 --> 10:21.350
I had created this party to be
recognized by the Tower,

10:21.350 --> 10:24.730
but unexpectedly
I have a better eye for people.

10:26.360 --> 10:27.820
It was a good party.

10:28.440 --> 10:33.560
As the youngest among the knights,
I thank you all.

10:46.290 --> 10:48.340
Are you hungry, Lihanna?

10:55.390 --> 10:56.590
Is it good?

10:57.010 --> 10:57.800
Yes.

10:58.680 --> 10:59.720
I want more.

11:00.150 --> 11:01.140
Sure.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.600
I want more.

11:05.600 --> 11:06.480
Sure.

11:07.610 --> 11:08.650
I want more.

11:08.650 --> 11:09.980
You still want to eat?

11:11.320 --> 11:12.230
I want more.

11:12.230 --> 11:13.110
Wait, what?

11:14.280 --> 11:15.150
I want more.

11:15.150 --> 11:16.490
Just how much do you eat?

11:16.490 --> 11:18.780
There's nothing left
for Will and the others.

11:18.780 --> 11:20.780
Were you such a glutton?

11:20.780 --> 11:21.990
You're wrong!

11:22.450 --> 11:24.830
The close combat magic
I use consumes

11:24.830 --> 11:27.500
a lot of physical strength
and magical power,

11:27.500 --> 11:30.670
that's why I have a poorer fuel consumption
than an average mage.

11:30.670 --> 11:35.010
Please don't mistake me for a glutton.

11:35.010 --> 11:36.760
I'm not lying,
I'm telling the truth.

11:41.220 --> 11:42.680
It's the truth.

11:42.680 --> 11:45.640
That last cute remark
doesn't convince me at all.

11:45.640 --> 11:48.020
You're just a hungry knight.

11:48.020 --> 11:49.980
No! You're wrong.

11:49.980 --> 11:53.610
To think Miss Perfect is like this...

11:53.610 --> 11:59.110
I was surprised too when I first learned
that she had a strong appetite.

11:59.490 --> 12:03.490
I'm an avid eater myself,
but I think Lihanna's more than me.

12:03.490 --> 12:06.620
Good grief!
This is already the last one.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.880
Let us return to the subject.

12:09.880 --> 12:12.130
Will, during that battle,

12:12.590 --> 12:17.510
without your judgment and courage,
we would have been annihilated.

12:17.510 --> 12:20.010
That is not true.

12:20.010 --> 12:24.470
Everyone worked together
and that's how we got through it.

12:24.470 --> 12:25.770
It's not just me.

12:25.770 --> 12:30.440
That's it! That flunkee nearly
got us all killed at one point.

12:30.440 --> 12:32.900
He said he was scared,
and he couldn't stop shaking.

12:32.900 --> 12:36.900
Proposing a plan that puts such
a burden on me in the first place

12:36.900 --> 12:38.320
is beyond brazen and reckless.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.280
Enough!

12:39.280 --> 12:41.780
Eat this and shut up!

12:42.950 --> 12:45.790
Stop it, not now!
I'll die!

12:46.700 --> 12:48.540
More importantly, Flunkee...

12:49.330 --> 12:53.040
What was that power that ate my spell?

12:54.040 --> 12:56.260
Yeah, that was amazing.

12:56.260 --> 12:59.800
It was so intense, so vibrant,
it made me hold my breath.

13:00.260 --> 13:03.300
It looked like it had contained the spell.

13:03.800 --> 13:06.810
But it wasn't an enchantment.

13:06.810 --> 13:10.810
I'm not even sure if we can call it magic.

13:12.350 --> 13:16.570
Right! If you had such power,
you should have told us first!

13:16.570 --> 13:19.950
Because of that,
you had put us all in danger.

13:20.700 --> 13:23.950
Stop it! Stop it, you familiar!
Don't scratch me!

13:24.410 --> 13:26.200
Answer it, Flunkee.

13:30.120 --> 13:33.790
I don't know about that myself.

13:33.790 --> 13:35.960
My head was blank
when that happened.

13:36.710 --> 13:37.840
And then...

13:42.720 --> 13:46.140
Maybe Professor Workner
and others know.

13:46.140 --> 13:48.270
We should try to ask them.

13:48.270 --> 13:53.440
I feel that phenomenon
was something special.

13:54.860 --> 13:56.010
Something special?

13:57.820 --> 14:03.320
By the way, I remember there was
a small boy on that expedition team.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.870
Do you know who he is?

14:05.320 --> 14:06.990
A small boy?

14:09.330 --> 14:11.370
That supporter?

14:11.370 --> 14:14.370
He may be someone from the Finn tribe.

14:14.370 --> 14:16.380
Finn tribe?

14:17.130 --> 14:21.130
I have read about them in the literature
that Owenzaus possesses.

14:22.130 --> 14:24.590
Although it's a tribe that
cannot use magic,

14:24.590 --> 14:29.390
those little people have accumulated
knowledge about dungeons for generations.

14:29.910 --> 14:33.100
Since the time of the Mage Queen,
they made a contract with the Tower

14:33.100 --> 14:36.650
to help with dungeon exploration
as guides.

14:36.650 --> 14:41.280
They said that it's impossible to go deeper
into the dungeon without their help.

14:43.990 --> 14:46.240
Dungeon guide.

14:46.740 --> 14:48.280
The Finn tribe.

14:50.330 --> 14:53.040
Including that power
when I defeated the Grand Duke,

14:53.710 --> 14:57.290
I wonder what that feeling was.

15:14.690 --> 15:15.390
Hey, Caldron.

15:15.390 --> 15:16.420
FINN
Hey, Caldron.

15:16.420 --> 15:18.560
FINN
I'm back.

15:18.560 --> 15:19.860
It's been a while, Finn.

15:19.860 --> 15:21.510
HEAD OF THE RIGARDEN MAGICAL ACADEMY
It's been a while, Finn.

15:21.510 --> 15:24.780
CALDRON JANOUB
Another long expedition, I see.

15:24.780 --> 15:27.160
How far did you get?

15:27.990 --> 15:29.580
The 49th floor.

15:29.580 --> 15:33.250
That Aaron really works people
to the bone.

15:33.790 --> 15:35.080
First things first,

15:35.750 --> 15:37.460
here's a souvenir for you.

15:38.790 --> 15:43.090
Is this the reported "Mage Slayer"?

15:43.460 --> 15:44.340
Yeah.

15:44.340 --> 15:48.390
We ran into some shady people on
the 40th floor and engaged in battle.

15:48.390 --> 15:52.100
About twenty high mages of
the expedition team were killed.

15:54.280 --> 15:57.850
They weren't opponents we could
hold back against, so we killed them.

15:57.850 --> 15:59.560
But I'm willing to bet.

15:59.560 --> 16:03.160
This Mage Slayer didn't just appear
naturally in the dungeon.

16:04.340 --> 16:07.700
They were probably doing tests
down there.

16:08.890 --> 16:14.240
Are you saying that they created this weapon
by combining a variety of materials,

16:14.240 --> 16:16.500
including those on the deeper floors?

16:19.880 --> 16:23.420
Aaron requested me to go back
for another survey.

16:23.420 --> 16:25.680
I'll leave the analysis of that to you.

16:26.420 --> 16:28.510
My apologies for imposing this on you.

16:29.500 --> 16:30.970
It's fine.

16:30.970 --> 16:34.010
It seems some nasty characters
are plotting behind the scenes.

16:34.010 --> 16:36.310
So you all need to be careful too.

16:36.770 --> 16:39.020
Now, on to the main topic.

16:41.980 --> 16:46.950
Why didn't you tell me
about that boy, Caldron?

16:47.900 --> 16:49.360
The wands are under yours,

16:49.750 --> 16:52.620
while the swords are supposed to
be under my jurisdiction.

16:54.910 --> 16:58.040
Will is a student of my academy.

16:58.040 --> 17:01.040
He's obsessed with wands
more than anything.

17:01.540 --> 17:06.380
He intends to climb the Tower
and reach the Magia Vander.

17:20.890 --> 17:23.940
I never heard of a sword aspiring
to become a wand.

17:24.400 --> 17:27.230
Yes, it's unprecedented.

17:27.230 --> 17:32.450
But I believe there'll be a new
and big impact that will be born out of this.

17:33.160 --> 17:34.700
Damn you, witch.

17:34.700 --> 17:37.700
All right, I don't dislike
playing such games.

17:38.620 --> 17:39.750
Fine.

17:40.580 --> 17:43.710
I'll leave him with you all for now.

17:43.710 --> 17:47.840
But from now on,
I'll be meddling in his affairs as well.

17:47.840 --> 17:49.970
Yes, do as you please.

17:50.800 --> 17:53.800
All for the sake of overcoming the sky.

18:02.630 --> 18:03.730
I can't believe it.

18:04.150 --> 18:08.980
Everyone is injured pretty badly,
but only you're able to move.

18:10.910 --> 18:13.820
I just couldn't stand still.

18:14.990 --> 18:17.910
There are a lot of things
I don't understand,

18:17.910 --> 18:20.250
but I have to move forward.

18:21.790 --> 18:23.870
Because there's a place I want to reach.

18:25.500 --> 18:29.760
What kind of body does he have?

18:30.170 --> 18:34.010
Pretty sure he's not a mage,
but rather a dwarf, isn't he?

18:34.010 --> 18:38.760
Please don't lump an elf's friend
with barbarians like the Dwarves.

18:38.760 --> 18:41.270
He is a warrior worthy of respect.

18:41.890 --> 18:48.400
But then again, maybe that simplicity
and dedication are his very strengths.

18:53.700 --> 18:55.200
Flunkee!

18:55.200 --> 18:57.120
Fight me!

19:02.250 --> 19:03.910
What are you talking about, Sion?

19:03.910 --> 19:06.460
Look at your body,
it'll be impossible for now.

19:07.170 --> 19:10.590
If he can move, then I can too.

19:11.210 --> 19:14.630
Sion, you shouldn't be
so hard on yourself.

19:14.630 --> 19:17.220
Besides, we can't just start fighting.

19:17.590 --> 19:18.470
You said it yourself.

19:20.220 --> 19:25.480
You said that we'll have a proper fight
after the Grand Magic Festival.

19:27.850 --> 19:29.480
Keep your word.

19:29.480 --> 19:31.110
Look at me!

19:31.110 --> 19:34.990
As if someone who can't defeat me
could ever advance to the Tower!

19:36.740 --> 19:38.120
Got it.

19:38.120 --> 19:40.370
All right then, Sion.

19:40.370 --> 19:42.490
Let's continue our fight!

19:42.900 --> 19:45.250
Hey, Will! Sion!

19:46.420 --> 19:47.710
Prepare yourself!

19:50.940 --> 19:51.670
Yeah!

21:15.210 --> 21:18.340
It's been two months since
the All-Student Praxis accident.

21:18.340 --> 21:21.890
I'm sure that many of you
may still feel uneasy.

21:21.890 --> 21:26.680
Nonetheless, we can't allow
your learning to stall.

21:27.350 --> 21:31.100
I've done everything I could do
since then.

21:31.620 --> 21:33.310
The school year's almost over.

21:33.980 --> 21:39.860
And, as sixth-year students,
this will be your final exam.

21:39.860 --> 21:41.740
I'll be able to meet her soon.

21:42.160 --> 21:45.780
Day one of the graduation exams...

21:46.240 --> 21:47.240
...begins!

21:49.000 --> 21:50.290
To meet Elfie.

